stateDiagram-v2
    %% Diagram C: Game state transitions
    [*] --> HOME
    HOME --> START : Start button clicked
    START --> HOME : Back button clicked
    START --> GAME : Start button clicked<br/>(new GameSession, timer starts)
    GAME --> GAME_OVER : Timer reaches 0<br/>or QUIT button clicked
    GAME_OVER --> START : Play Again clicked<br/>(new GameSession)
    GAME_OVER --> HOME : Main Menu clicked

    state GAME {
        [*] --> WaitingForPose
        WaitingForPose --> WaitingForPose : target stable (up to 7s)
        WaitingForPose --> WaitingForPose : match! score++, new target
        WaitingForPose --> [*] : game finished
    }

    note right of HOME : Main menu<br/>Start / Quit buttons
    note right of START : Webcam preview<br/>high score shown
    note right of GAME : 60s timer,<br/>target pose changes every 7s<br/>+1.5s per match
    note right of GAME_OVER : Final score, time played,<br/>high score, time/move
